<servinfosub id = "AENKSB0A1144035003">
<title>
DTC Confirmation Procedure
</title>
<topic id = "AENKSB0A1144035004">
<title>
P0197
</title>
<attention3>
<ptxt>
Check that the following DTC is not detected in this “DTC Confirmation Procedure”.
</ptxt>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Engine oil temperature sensor (P0198)
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</attention3>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Warm up engine to normal operating temperature.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Run engine at idle speed for 1 min.
</ptxt>
</s1>
</topic>
<topic id = "AENKSB0A1144035005">
<title>
P0198
</title>
<attention3>
<ptxt>
Check that the following DTC is not detected in this “DTC Confirmation Procedure”.
</ptxt>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Engine oil temperature sensor (P0197)
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</attention3>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Warm up engine to normal operating temperature.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Run engine at idle speed for 1 min.
</ptxt>
</s1>
</topic>
